WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:02.320
This was literally my life:

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:05.160
scrolling, saving,
and doing absolutely nothing.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.120
I had, like, 200 saved places on my phone,
but never went to one.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.920
Until I found this app: ReelToDo.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:13.120
Pick your vibe.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:14.900
Choose how many things you want to do,

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.180
what you are into, connect your socials,

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:20.700
import your saved spots, and boom,
it turns into real plans.

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:25.380
From restaurants to museums to new spots,
ReelToDo handles it all.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.340
So, what are you waiting for?

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:32.160
Stop scrolling and start going.
